OL,3,GNEWSACouncil using offenders to clean
OL,4,Aup town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who have committed minor crimes
OL,7,Fare cleaning up Swindon town centre as
OL,8,Fpart of their sentences.
OL,10,FThe community payback programme sees
OL,11,Fthose convicted do unpaid work in their
OL,12,Flocal area.
OL,14,FIn Swindon, groups are taking part in
OL,15,Fthe Big Town Centre Clean-Up, a council
OL,16,Fscheme to tidy up the streets in
OL,17,Fresponse to calls from residents.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
