OL,3,GNEWSACouncil using offenders to clean
OL,4,Aup town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt Hinton, cabinet member for
OL,7,Fcommunity engagement, safety and
OL,8,Fservices, said: "Once these sessions
OL,9,Fhave been completed, we will explore
OL,10,Fhow community payback could play a
OL,11,Fwider role in supporting communities
OL,12,Facross Swindon and helping to address
OL,13,Fenvironmental issues that matter to
OL,14,Fresidents."
